{"id":"steam-304830","steam":304830,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"No Signal: Chornobyl","summary":"No Signal is a strictly online co-op psychological horror game set in the abandoned Chornobyl Exclusion Zone. Explore decaying towns, solve tasks together, and question everything—because you and your partner may not be seeing the same reality.","about":"You are the first in many years to breach the Chornobyl Exclusion Zone. Your main trials will be the space itself, the oppressive silence, and your own mind.\n\n\r\nImmerse yourself in the chilling atmosphere of abandoned villages and towns, where there are no straight paths or trodden roads.\n\nKey features:\n\n• \nCo-op on the edge of paranoia: Your progress depends entirely on close cooperation with your partner. You will have to divide tasks and coordinate actions. But how can you trust each other when you see completely different things?\n• \nSubtle psychological horror: The slowly maddening silence, paranoia, and distrust. Are you sure you can trust your partner?\n• \nEveryday realism of the 2010s: Explore abandoned panel houses, rusty bus stops, and dilapidated village houses.\n\nNo Signal is a strictly online co-op experience.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304830/0d404764493745e81683aa3c0c5a3d0744db0e42/library_capsule.jpg?t=1792927934","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304830/3db98be93bc50450ee842c76d1b7232a0354981a/header.jpg?t=1792927934","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304830/ba02868b820a48d7ac1046b5345fa12e19b1d7d4/library_hero.jpg?t=1792927934","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304830/3db98be93bc50450ee842c76d1b7232a0354981a/header.jpg?t=1792927934","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/304830/c929c139814ac0c25eeece5aca6e424bb93d4877/ss_c929c139814